        "band_heading": "Unleash the Full Potential of Your Chevy Silverado 1500 2019 - 2026",
        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>Stop worrying about weight limits and start adventuring with confidence. <strong>Offroad Industries (ORI)</strong> offers the most comprehensive, Federally Approved GVM (Gross Vehicle Mass) upgrades for the Chevy Silverado 1500 (LTZ, Trail Boss, and ZR2).</p><p><strong>ORI now has approval for MY26i Silverado LTZ and ZR2</strong></p><p>By bundling the <strong>ORI GVM Packages &amp; GCM testing</strong> and the combination of <strong>LS16 certification</strong>, you are offering a legal \"Super-Truck\" status. The <strong>LS16 code</strong> is the secret sauce here: it’s the specific modification code for <strong>Gross Combination Mass Re-rating</strong>, ensuring the truck, the gear, and the massive 4.5T trailer are all 100% legal together for either PRE or Post Rego.</p><p>Whether you’re a weekend explorer, a tradie with a heavy load, or a serious tourer towing a 4.5T caravan, our staged packages transform your truck’s legality, safety, and performance.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "<p>*Please note that some workshops may apply additional discretionary administration fees to the quoted installation and engineering price. Additionally, all Post-Registration GVM upgrades will incur additional local fees. Shipping is not included in the price.</p>",
